  m_Name: Subrog
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Rarety: 2
  m_Description: Subrog, the Eclipse Assassin, is a master of stealth and lethal
    precision, wielding the duality of light and shadow. Empowered by the celestial
    forces of the eclipse, Subrog strikes from the darkness with ruthless efficiency,
    blending black and white energy in a deadly dance of destruction. His abilities
    reflect his mastery of both concealment and overwhelming force, making him a
    formidable foe to any who dare face him
  m_DescriptionVariables: []
